-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party models (not shipped in this repo)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct
  Role: JSON router via Ollama (text only, no pixels)
  Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct
  License: Apache License 2.0 (Qwen research license terms may also apply
  to some checkpoints — check the model card before redistribution)

InternVL3-1B (OpenGVLab)
  Role: talking VLM (replaces GeoChat-7B at implementation)
  Source: https://huggingface.co/OpenGVLab/InternVL3-1B
  License: MIT (confirm the model card)

GeoChat (MBZUAI)
  Role: architecture citation; graph tool IDs remain geochat_vqa /
  geochat_describe even though the talking VLM is InternVL3-1B
  Paper: arXiv:2311.15826
  Source: https://github.com/mbzuai-oryx/GeoChat

BIT (Change detection)
  Role: silent change mask specialist (currently mocked)
  Paper: arXiv:2103.00208
  Source: https://github.com/justchenhao/BIT_CD

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Python dependencies are declared in requirements.txt.
Frontend dependencies are declared in web/package.json.

Notable stacks: FastAPI, LangGraph, SQLAlchemy, GeoAlchemy2, Rasterio,
PostgreSQL/PostGIS, React, Vite, MapLibre GL, TanStack Query/Router, Zod.

