Data
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/fixtures/cartosat2s_demo.tif is a development fixture for ingest
smoke tests. Operational Cartosat / RISAT / Sentinel scenes remain the
property of their respective agencies and must not be committed here.
Generated job artifacts under data/jobs/ are gitignored.
